    <data key="d0">Levels Beyond Media to Cloud Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07lfvavMdfU</data>
    <data key="d2">Automated serverless media ingest, AI/ML metadata extraction, and proxy generation workflow using AWS Step Functions, MediaConvert, Rekognition, Transcribe, Comprehend, and DynamoDB powering Reach Engine on EC2/ECS.</data>
